## Impact Analysis

### 1. Authorization / Privilege Escalation

```javascript
// Server returns: {"role":"viewer","isAdmin":false}
// Application sees: {"role":"admin","isAdmin":true}
// → Application grants admin access to unprivileged user
```

### 2. Financial Manipulation

```javascript
